# mightexChannel.req
#
# Per-channel autosave request file, instantiated once per channel via
# the top-level mightex_autosave.req (one "file" line per channel with
# different P=/R= macros -- NOT loaded directly with 16 separate
# set_pass0_restoreFile calls, to sidestep the known create_monitor_set()
# filename-collision issue when many instances share one request file
# name).
#
# Deliberately excluded:
#   - Mode-Sel: restoring commanded mode on IOC boot could silently
#     re-enable an LED with no operator action. Mode-Sel is forced to
#     Disable via PINI=YES instead (see mightexChannel.template) --
#     every IOC start is guaranteed off, never "whatever it was before".
#   - Mode-Sts, Current-RB, TimedOut-Sts, OnTimeAccum, OnTimeCheck,
#     TimeoutAction, ClearTimedOut-Sts: readbacks/internal watchdog
#     plumbing, not configuration -- nothing meaningful to restore.
#
# Included: pure configuration. Restoring these alone never turns
# anything on by itself.
$(P)$(R)Normal-SP
$(P)$(R)Current-SP
$(P)$(R)Strobe-SP
$(P)$(R)MaxOnTime-SP
